# ADRs Upsert-Only Policy

- `docs/adrs/ADRs.md` is upsert-only.
- Never rewrite, delete, or reorder existing ADR entries.
- Never modify existing ADR text in place (including ADR 19).
- Additions must be append-only:
  - add a new ADR, or
  - append a dated addendum section without altering prior content.
- If a request conflicts with this policy, preserve existing ADR content and suggest an append-only alternative.
